Fonts from a folder (docs/w6.md W6b). WebCore's Skia ports find fonts
with Fontconfig everywhere but Android and Windows; Kosmos's are files in
a folder, read by Skia's own manager for one, as W5e decided for Skia
(0012-skia-on-kosmos.patch). The folder is kosmosFontFolder()
(platform/kosmos/FontFolderKosmos.h, a port file), and a character no font
has falls back through the manager, as Android and Windows ask theirs -
which for a folder is no font yet, so Fontconfig's cache of fallbacks is
not built.

--- a/Source/WebCore/platform/graphics/skia/FontCacheSkia.cpp	2026-11-13 13:13:40.380231764 -0300
